    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu yidika nawuŋaji, wumwakasha muchima wakwilamu mafuku ejima imwakahanda hamaseki, omu mwituŋa danayinkiyi Yehova Nzambi yawankakulula jeyi kudiheta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunyuzoyu yimwakaheta, hejima hakapeshaŋawu akishi awu, hela hampidi jamaneni, hela hampidi janyanya, hela mumashina anyitondu yituuta yejima, chiŋa mwakakisaŋanahu shatichikupu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwakahumoni tumeŋa twawu, mwakafumpoli nituposhi twawu twakupeshela puchi puchi, ninyiyombu yawu mwakayochi mukesi, niakishiakusoŋa kufwikŋa akishi awu mwakayitemi; mwakajiyishi ijina dawuchikupu kwenoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwakamwilaŋa Yehova Nzambi yenu chochochuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa chipela chakatondayi Yehova Nzambi yenu mukachikanyuza yenu yejima nindi ashuku ijina dindi, kafwampi kwokwashakamayi yena, diku kumwakakeŋa, diku kumwakaya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "diku kumwakatwalaŋani nyilambu yenu yakushita, niyimuna yenu yakuketula, niyenu yamwikumi, ninyilambu yenu yakuleleka yimwakalambulaŋa, nikudishiila kwenu, ninyilambu yenu yakuhana chakunyichima yenu, nawedi akumataŋenu nakumayi ndenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "diku kumwakadiila kumesu aYehova Nzambi yenu, ninenu niakumatalenu, himwakazaŋalala nayuma yejima yimwaka kwatachikasa yakayikoolekeshelayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwakelaŋayuma yejimiyi yitwelaŋa kunu lelu, yakoŋaŋa antu ejima iwu mwanamoniyikuloŋa, iwu mwanamoniyi kuloŋaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa muchidi kanda mushikikukunooka nikuwuswana wakukwinkayi Yehova Nzambi yeyuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa chimukuzambuka Yodana nakushakama mwituŋa dakuyinkayi Yehova Nzambi yenu nindi mudiswani, chakayinookeshayi kudi ayilumbujenu ejima ayinyeŋumuka kwi-ndo, neyi munashakami dehi chakadi woma; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwakatwalaŋa kuchipela chakatondayi Yehova Nzambi yenu, nindiashakamishuku ijina dindi, yejima yinakayilejaŋa; ninyilambu yenu yakushita, niyimuna yenu yakuketula, niyenu yamwikumi, ninyilambu yenu yakuleleka yimwakahanaŋa, nikudishiila kwenu kwejima kwasweja kuwahakumwakadishiila kudi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himwakazaŋalalaŋa kumesu aYehova Nzambi yenu, ninenu ni anyanenu amayala ni anyanenu awambanda, niaŋambajenu amayala, ni aŋamba jenu awambanda, nikaLevi wakekala hamukalawenu, muloŋa yena hakweti hela iseka hela wuswana hamu nanenuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babalaku wakenza kalambula nyilambu yeyi yakushita kwonsu kuwunamoni kwoku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chiŋa chipela chakatondayi Yehova kumuza wenu wumu, diku kwenoku hohu kuwakatwalaŋa nyilambu yeyi yakushita, dikukuwakelaŋa mwejima munakakulejaŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza kujaha mbiji nakuyidya, mwakajahaŋa tuhu nakudya munyikalayenu yejima, mwonsu mwakeŋa ela nyichima yenu, mwakayikoolekeshelayi Yehova Nzambi yenu nakuyinka; niamajilu niatooka akatweshaŋa kudya neyi chadyaŋawu mbaala nankayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwinza mashi bayi mwakayidyaku; mwakayimwaŋilaŋa hamaseki neyi meji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamwikumi yatidikuyeyi, hela yavinyu yeyi, hela yamanji eyi, hela tuhu awedi akwitaŋa deyinakwiyinda deyi, hela kudishiila kuwakadishiila, hela nyilambu yeyi yakulambula chakumuchima weyi, hela himulambu wakuleleka wuwakalambulaŋa, kutwesha kuyidiila kumukala weyi nehi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chiŋa wakayidiila kumesu aYehova Nzambi yeyi kuchipela chakatondayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi, wakadya nineyi, nimwaneyi weyala, nimwaneyi wamumbanda, niŋambayeyi weyala, niŋamba yeyi wamumbanda, nikaLevi wakekala hamukalaweyi; hiwakazaŋalala kumesu aYehova Nzambi yeyi nayuma yejima yiwakakwata chikasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babalaku wakabuli kumúumba kaLevi nyakaye jima yiwakashakama mwituŋa deyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakatoheshayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi ŋinza yeyi mwakukaniniyi hiwakela neyi, ami nakeŋi kudya mbiji; ochu chiwunakeŋi mumuchimaweyi kudya mbiji, wakadya tuhu mwonsu mwakeŋa ela muchima weyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi kuchipela chakatondayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi kushaku ijina dindikunakuleheli, wakajahi yanakwinkiyi Yehova hela yakwitaŋa deyi helayakwiyinda deyi, mwomu munakuleji, wakadiili tuhu hamukala weyimwonsu munakeŋi muchima weyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakadyi neyi chimwadyaŋa mbaala nankayi, niamajilu niatooka fakudya tuhu hohamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helachochu, chiŋa wakashinshikaŋa wakabuli kudya mashi; muloŋa mashi diwuwumi, bayi wakadiila wumi hamu nambŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakayidyaŋaku, wakayimwaŋilaŋa hamaseki neyi meji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakayidyaŋaku kulonda wakashakami chachiwahi, nianyaneyi akalondelaŋamu, chiwakelaŋa chaloŋa kumesu aYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa yuma yeyi yajila yiwukweti niyiwadishiila wakayisendi, wakayi nayu kuchipela chakatondayi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyilambuyeyi yakushita, wakalambuli nimbiji nimashi, hakameŋa kaYehova Nzambi yeyi; mashi ayimuna yeyi yiwakaketulaŋi wakayi mwaŋilaŋa hakamena kaYehova Nzambi yeyi, mbiji wakadya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaku muchima wutiyi mazu awa ejima inukukuleja, kulonda wakashakami chachiwahi nineyi nianyaneyiamba kakulondelaŋa, chiwakelaŋa chachiwahi chaloŋa kumesu aYehova Nzambi yeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
