              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakela anayijilumuni dehi, wakababalaŋa kuchina kufwamumuhetu wakulondela mwelaŋawu; kuchina kwihujola akishi awu, hiwakela neyi, Indi nyuziyi yapeshaŋa ŋahi akishi awu? Ninami nilumunawa. ",
          "type": "text",
