              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakamwilaŋa Yehova Nzambi yeyi chochochuku; muloŋayejima yahelaŋayi Yehova yamonaŋayi nindi yakushimana, diyi yelilaŋawu akishi awu; muloŋa hela anyanawu amayala hela anyanawu awambanda ayochelaŋa tuhu akishi awu mukesi.",
          "type": "text",
